-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"楚公子圍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000417","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m016-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"夾敖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m016-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000417","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m016-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000417","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m016-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代；有虞等不直接補作熟知個人，仍待覆核。"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m016-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"慶封","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000419","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p064","text":"丁丑，崔杼立莊公異母弟杵臼，是為景公。景公母，魯叔孫宣伯女也。景公立，以崔杼為右相，慶封為左相。二相恐亂起，乃與國人盟曰：「不與崔慶者死！」晏子仰天曰：「嬰所不（獲）唯忠於君利社稷者是從！」不肯盟。慶封欲殺晏子，崔杼曰：「忠臣也，捨之。」齊太史書曰「崔杼弒莊公」，崔杼殺之。其弟復書，崔杼復殺之。少弟復書，崔杼乃捨之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m064-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"崔杼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000263","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m064-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m064-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"杵臼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001072","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m064-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001072","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m064-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001072","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji